  "description": "Unleash fun and adventure with Sunset Bikes for GIRLS! Designed for ages 5 to 12 Years, these vibrant bikes come in three sizes—16\", 18\", and 20\"—perfect for every young rider. The 16\" and 18\" feature adjustable training wheels, while the 20\" has a convenient kickstand for easy stops. Enjoy quick assembly with just two tools (included) and a foldable crank—no complicated setups here! Safety meets style with a front hand brake and coaster brake, plus a custom paint effect that will turn heads. Your little one will love the handlebar basket for treasures and playful streamers that dance in the breeze. Ideal for fun-filled rides in the neighborhood or at the park, Sunset Bikes guarantee smiles and memories! Get yours today and let the adventures begin!",
